<title>JAPAN: GOLF-CHUNICHI CROWNS TOURNAMENT THIRD ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-CHUNICHI CROWNS TOURNAMENT THIRD ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>NAGOYA 1997-05-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores after the third round of the $1 million Chunichi Crowns golf tournament at the 6,455-yard, par-70 course here on Saturday Japanese unless noted):</p>
<p>200 Masashi Ozaki 67 67 66</p>
<p>201 Greg Norman (Australia) 66 68 67, Brian Watts (U.S.)</p>
<p>67 65 69</p>
<p>202 Taichi Teshima 62 70 70</p>
<p>203 Kazuhiro Takami 67 67 69</p>
<p>205 Rick Gibson (Canada) 68 70 67, Nobuo Serizawa</p>
<p>69 68 68</p>
<p>206 Ikuo Shirahama 66 72 68, Tateo Ozaki 67 68 71</p>
<p>207 Kiyoshi Maita 69 68 70, Nobumitsu Yuhara 71 64 72,</p>
<p>Kaname Yokoo 67 68 72, Kiyoshi Murota 69 65 73</p>
<p>208 Shigeki Maruyama 71 68 69, Tsuyoshi Yoneyama</p>
<p>67 72 69, David Ishii (U.S.) 69 70 69, Peter</p>
<p>McWhinney (Australia) 69 68 71, David Smail</p>
<p>(New Zealand) 66 70 72, Saburo Fujiki 70 66 72,</p>
<p>Satoshi Higashi 67 68 73</p>
</text>
